+# Requirements: report export
+
+Status: approved
+Approved: 2026-11-18
+
+## Intent
+
+Finance copies the report table into spreadsheets by hand every week. They want to take the report
+out of reportkit in a file instead, with the same columns as the table.
+
+## Requirements
+
+- R1. A user can export the report as a CSV file, one row per report line, with the table's columns.
+- R2. A user can export the report as a PDF file that looks like the reports page.
+- R3. An export holds only the lines the current region filter shows.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- Scheduled or emailed exports.
